WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:03.901
♪♪

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:06.000
-If you don't mind,
I'm gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.133
President Biden on Thursday
delivered

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.834
a rare prime time address

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.734
from Philadelphia's
Independence Hall,

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:13.400
and not,
as I originally thought,

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.133
the Upside Down.

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:18.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.934
That is a wild lighting choice.

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:24.334
I...kept expecting him
to be interrupted by Vecna.

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:28.501
President Biden traveled
to Pittsburgh yesterday,

00:00:28.501 --> 00:00:30.701
which was his third trip
to Pennsylvania

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:31.834
in less than a week.

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:34.200
Not to be outdone,
Dr. Oz also made

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.734
his third trip to Pennsylvania.

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:38.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.801 --> 00:00:40.601
Election day is nine weeks away,

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:42.934
and only time will tell
if Republicans gain seats

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.267
or if it was rigged.

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:46.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:49.467
President Biden
and First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:52.334
are set to host the Obamas
on Wednesday at the White House

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.234
for the unveiling of
their official portraits,

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:56.934
and you can tell
Biden misses the old days,

00:00:56.934 --> 00:00:59.400
because this is
his official portrait.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:07.767
Maine Senator Susan Collins
said in a new interview

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:10.434
that she believes that Senate
Majority Leader Chuck Schumer

00:01:10.434 --> 00:01:13.634
will get a vote on same-sex
marriage protections this month

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:15.100
but added that she hopes

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.234
he will "resist the urge to play
politics with the bill."

00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:20.801
It's the Senate.
It's all politics.

00:01:20.801 --> 00:01:22.400
That's like saying

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:25.434
you hope the Jets resist
the urge to play football.

00:01:25.434 --> 00:01:28.367
Okay, Jets...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:31.000
Jets is a bad example, but...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.834
...you get the point.

00:01:32.834 --> 00:01:35.267
During his speech in Wisconsin
yesterday, President Biden

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:38.968
said that not every Republican
is "a MAGA Republican,"

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:40.000
which is a little like saying

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.100
that not every zombie
eats brains.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.467
Maybe, but they also don't mind

00:01:44.467 --> 00:01:46.234
if the other zombies
eat your brain.

00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:47.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:50.000
Two Air France pilots
were suspended recently

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.400
after a physical fight
in the cockpit during a flight.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.067
The fight
was reportedly so intense

00:01:54.067 --> 00:01:56.200
that one of them
dropped his cigarette.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.434 --> 00:02:02.033
New -- [ Chuckles ]

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:05.300
New footage of the Titanic
wreckage was recently released

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.334
in the highest screen resolution
currently available.

00:02:08.334 --> 00:02:09.801
They zoomed in as far
as they could,

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:11.033
and bad news, you guys --

00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:12.033
no survivors.

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:14.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:15.934
[ Woman "aws" ]

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:17.801
Well, we know now.

00:02:17.801 --> 00:02:21.100
It's high resolution,
so we know now.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:27.200
You know what would be worse?

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.367
A survivor.

00:02:28.367 --> 00:02:30.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.534 --> 00:02:33.701
"Aw."

00:02:37.067 --> 00:02:38.567
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:38.567 --> 00:02:40.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:43.167
A large spill of Alfredo sauce

00:02:43.167 --> 00:02:46.100
recently shut down an interstate
highway in Tennessee.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.901
Well, it wouldn't be
the first time

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:50.300
Alfredo sauce
clogged a major artery.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.868 --> 00:02:56.067
Now, we're -- You know,
when we read a story like that

00:02:56.067 --> 00:02:58.767
we're worried, obviously,
that our monologue writers

00:02:58.767 --> 00:03:00.200
caused the accident.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.767 --> 00:03:07.667
According to New York State Park
officials,

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:10.300
hundreds of people at Long
Island beaches over the weekend

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.567
were stung by jellyfish.

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:13.467
At least, I assume that's why

00:03:13.467 --> 00:03:14.968
they were all peeing
on each other.

00:03:14.968 --> 00:03:18.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:21.000
That's my assumption.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.901
And finally, rapper Eminem won
an Emmy Award over the weekend

00:03:24.901 --> 00:03:26.501
and now just needs a Tony Award

00:03:26.501 --> 00:03:28.934
to achieve
so-called EGOT status,

00:03:28.934 --> 00:03:31.901
so look for him this fall
in "Dear Evan Hansen."

00:03:31.901 --> 00:03:33.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.934 --> 00:03:37.634
FBI agents reportedly found
a document while searching

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:39.934
former President Trump's
Mar-A-Lago residence

00:03:39.934 --> 00:03:43.300
that detailed a foreign
country's nuclear capabilities.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:46.234
Even crazier, it was Luxembourg.

00:03:46.234 --> 00:03:48.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.067 --> 00:03:50.968
Former President Obama returned
today to the White House.

00:03:50.968 --> 00:03:53.167
Oh, God, it must have been
like one of those videos

00:03:53.167 --> 00:03:56.234
where a dog's owner
returns from the war.

00:03:56.234 --> 00:03:58.300
[ As Obama ] "Joe, Joe!
I'm happy to see you, too.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.234
All right, get down, Joe,
get down."

00:04:00.234 --> 00:04:02.934
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.934 --> 00:04:05.634
[ Normal voice ] Former Trump
strategist Steve Bannon

00:04:05.634 --> 00:04:07.868
is reportedly expected
to turn himself in

00:04:07.868 --> 00:04:09.667
to New York state
prosecutors tomorrow

00:04:09.667 --> 00:04:12.667
to face a criminal indictment,
and if he's convicted,

00:04:12.667 --> 00:04:15.534
he could actually find himself,
for the first time,

00:04:15.534 --> 00:04:17.400
sleeping indoors.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.834
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.834 --> 00:04:22.934
During a White House
coronavirus briefing yesterday,

00:04:22.934 --> 00:04:25.367
Dr. Anthony Fauci
said the COVID vaccines

00:04:25.367 --> 00:04:28.267
will likely become annual,
like flu shots or,

00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:30.367
you know, mask-wearing.

00:04:30.367 --> 00:04:32.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.501 --> 00:04:34.334
In a new interview,
Hillary Clinton said

00:04:34.334 --> 00:04:36.567
that she started wearing
pantsuits in the '90s

00:04:36.567 --> 00:04:39.934
while she was First Lady
after a Brazilian ad agency

00:04:39.934 --> 00:04:43.968
used a photo of her wearing
a skirt in a lingerie campaign.

00:04:43.968 --> 00:04:47.033
And I don't think I need to tell
you who was the first to notice.

00:04:47.033 --> 00:04:49.234
"Hey, Hillary,
you're in a magazine!"

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:51.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:54.501 --> 00:04:56.767
It was reported yesterday that
Pennsylvania Senate candidate

00:04:56.767 --> 00:05:00.734
Dr. Mehmet Oz once said
in an interview that incest is

00:05:00.734 --> 00:05:04.501
"not a big problem if you're
more than a first cousin away."

00:05:04.501 --> 00:05:08.601
Replied the interviewer, "My
question was about tax policy."

00:05:08.601 --> 00:05:10.534
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.133 --> 00:05:16.133
According to a new survey,
16% of Americans said

00:05:16.133 --> 00:05:18.100
that they share
and track locations

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.434
with their friends and family.

00:05:19.434 --> 00:05:22.734
Though, honestly, a lot of them
do now regret that.

00:05:22.734 --> 00:05:25.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.567 --> 00:05:32.934
"Should we check on
where Uncle Tom is?"

00:05:32.934 --> 00:05:36.133
Ay-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi-yi!

00:05:36.133 --> 00:05:37.801
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin

00:05:37.801 --> 00:05:40.067
returned from the Senate's
August recess yesterday

00:05:40.067 --> 00:05:42.901
with his right sling --
right arm in a sling.

00:05:42.901 --> 00:05:44.767
But that's also his right sling.

00:05:44.767 --> 00:05:48.200
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.734
West Virginia Senat-- Oh.

00:05:49.734 --> 00:05:51.200
[ Laughter ]

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.968
Oh, it's coming off the rails.

00:05:52.968 --> 00:05:55.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.033 --> 00:06:01.467
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin returned

00:06:01.467 --> 00:06:03.334
from the Senate's
August recess yesterday

00:06:03.334 --> 00:06:04.767
with his right arm in a sling.

00:06:04.767 --> 00:06:07.701
Well, now we know how Biden
got his climate bill passed.

00:06:07.701 --> 00:06:09.701
[ Laughter ]

00:06:13.467 --> 00:06:16.434
Um, yeah, I think we ordered
this with a neck!

00:06:16.434 --> 00:06:19.234
[ Laughter ]

00:06:19.234 --> 00:06:20.968
You know, the Biden picture.

00:06:20.968 --> 00:06:22.801
[ Laughter ]

00:06:27.434 --> 00:06:30.267
Rapper Snoop Dogg has announced
that he's releasing

00:06:30.267 --> 00:06:31.534
a new breakfast cereal...

00:06:31.534 --> 00:06:33.133
[ Laughter ]

00:06:33.133 --> 00:06:34.834
...called Snoop Loopz.

00:06:34.834 --> 00:06:38.601
And if you thought your kids
fought over the prize before...

00:06:38.601 --> 00:06:40.901
[ Laughter ]

00:06:44.734 --> 00:06:47.000
[ Slurring ]
"No, it didn't have a prize."

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:51.567 --> 00:06:54.868
New York's education chancellor,
David Banks, confirmed yesterday

00:06:54.868 --> 00:06:57.868
that public school students will
not get snow days this year.

00:06:57.868 --> 00:07:02.200
When asked why, he said, "'Cause
it's 91 degrees in September."

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:03.400
[ Laughter ]

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:06.133
And finally,
Target recently issued a recall

00:07:06.133 --> 00:07:08.100
for white fudge animal cookies,

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.367
because they potentially contain
metal wire.

00:07:10.367 --> 00:07:14.100
Even worse, apparently,
they also contain white fudge.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:16.234 --> 00:07:19.033
At the White House ceremony
for the unveiling

00:07:19.033 --> 00:07:22.033
of former President Obama
and First Lady Michelle Obama's

00:07:22.033 --> 00:07:24.400
official portraits,
President Biden said

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:25.601
Obama was one of the,

00:07:25.601 --> 00:07:28.400
"most consequential presidents
in our history."

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.734
"That is true,"

00:07:29.734 --> 00:07:31.734
said the consequence.

00:07:31.734 --> 00:07:34.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:34.234 --> 00:07:36.834
New York Governor Kathy Hochul
announced yesterday

00:07:36.834 --> 00:07:39.834
that masks will be optional
on public transportation.

00:07:39.834 --> 00:07:42.000
This comes almost 18 months

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.167
after passengers made
the same announcement.

00:07:45.167 --> 00:07:46.501
[ Laughter ]

00:07:46.501 --> 00:07:48.834
"What?

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:51.000
Starting today? Okay."

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.501
[ Laughter ]

00:07:52.501 --> 00:07:54.968
Former Trump strategist
Steve Bannon turned himself in

00:07:54.968 --> 00:07:57.801
to New York authorities today
to face state criminal charges.

00:07:57.801 --> 00:07:59.801
Well, the good news is,
I'm positive

00:07:59.801 --> 00:08:02.868
this man knows how
to make toilet wine.

00:08:02.868 --> 00:08:05.534
[ Laughter ]

00:08:05.534 --> 00:08:08.033
The White House announced
that President Biden will travel

00:08:08.033 --> 00:08:09.234
to Boston on Monday

00:08:09.234 --> 00:08:11.567
to speak about his initiative
to end cancer.

00:08:11.567 --> 00:08:14.200
'Cause if there's one thing
we've learned from Boston --

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:15.868
anything is possible.

00:08:15.868 --> 00:08:17.868
[ Laughter ]

00:08:17.868 --> 00:08:19.701
He got her back!

00:08:19.701 --> 00:08:21.300
[ Laughter ]

00:08:23.033 --> 00:08:25.868
Democratic Senate candidate
John Fetterman agreed yesterday

00:08:25.868 --> 00:08:27.868
to debate Republican
Dr. Mehmet Oz.

00:08:27.868 --> 00:08:30.701
Apparently he's trying
to get under Oz's skin

00:08:30.701 --> 00:08:33.367
by making him drive back
to Pennsylvania.

00:08:33.367 --> 00:08:35.200
[ Laughter ]

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.434
"Ah, put it in Google Maps!"

00:08:37.434 --> 00:08:38.901
That's right.

00:08:38.901 --> 00:08:41.400
Democratic Senate candidate
John Fetterman agreed yesterday

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:43.267
to debate Republican
Dr. Mehmet Oz.

00:08:43.267 --> 00:08:44.901
We're not sure when,

00:08:44.901 --> 00:08:47.801
so here's a clip from
"Punch-Out" to tide you over.

00:08:47.801 --> 00:08:51.868
♪♪

00:08:51.868 --> 00:08:53.801
[ Laughter ]

00:08:57.701 --> 00:08:59.334
-According to
the latest numbers,

00:08:59.334 --> 00:09:02.400
the average American
life expectancy has fallen

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.234
to 76.1 years old.

00:09:04.234 --> 00:09:05.567
But don't tell that

00:09:05.567 --> 00:09:07.734
to the 2024 election.

00:09:07.734 --> 00:09:09.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.100
[ As Biden ]
"Hey, we're both above average."

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:12.334
[ As Trump ]
"We are, it's true.

00:09:12.334 --> 00:09:15.501
We're both a little bit
better than average."

00:09:15.501 --> 00:09:17.834
[ Laughter ]

00:09:17.834 --> 00:09:19.367
[ Normal voice ]
According to new research,

00:09:19.367 --> 00:09:21.701
ocean water
in the Northern Hemisphere

00:09:21.701 --> 00:09:23.701
has been unusually warm.

00:09:23.701 --> 00:09:25.701
"Sorry," said this kid.

00:09:25.701 --> 00:09:27.534
[ Laughter ]

00:09:27.534 --> 00:09:29.200
Oh, yeah.

00:09:33.434 --> 00:09:34.934
I didn't know
what the face would be,

00:09:34.934 --> 00:09:36.767
but that's what
it's supposed to be.

00:09:36.767 --> 00:09:38.767
[ Laughter ]

00:09:38.767 --> 00:09:41.534
According to a new book, former
President Trump once tried

00:09:41.534 --> 00:09:44.801
to pay for an attorney's
legal fees with a horse.

00:09:44.801 --> 00:09:45.968
Not Rudy, though.

00:09:45.968 --> 00:09:48.634
When it was time to pay Rudy,
Trump said,

00:09:48.634 --> 00:09:51.133
"Does anyone have change
for a pigeon?"

00:09:51.133 --> 00:09:52.801
[ Laughter ]

00:09:56.968 --> 00:10:00.467
So, he wanted to pay him
with less than a pigeon.

00:10:00.467 --> 00:10:04.133
He wanted change -- he didn't
want to pay Rudy a full pigeon.

00:10:04.133 --> 00:10:05.968
He needed change for a pigeon

00:10:05.968 --> 00:10:10.133
to then give slightly less
than one pigeon's worth.

00:10:10.133 --> 00:10:12.634
[ As Giuliani ] "No one said
I did a full pigeon's worth!"

00:10:12.634 --> 00:10:14.133
[ Laughter ]

00:10:15.968 --> 00:10:17.968
[ Laughter continues ]

00:10:17.968 --> 00:10:19.968
[ Normal voice ] And finally,
officials in Nigeria

00:10:19.968 --> 00:10:24.000
recently seized 16 sacks filled
with thousands of donkey penises

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.834
that were set to be illegally
exported to Hong Kong.

00:10:26.834 --> 00:10:28.000
The mistake?

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.000
Bringing them as a carry-on.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.868
[ Laughter ]

00:10:33.601 --> 00:10:35.267
You know what the great thing
about that joke is?

00:10:35.267 --> 00:10:37.234
It doesn't answer
any of the questions I have

00:10:37.234 --> 00:10:39.234
about the news story.

00:10:39.234 --> 00:10:41.133
We just all assumed
the audience would be like,

00:10:41.133 --> 00:10:43.968
"Uh-huh, cool,
16,000 donkey penises.

00:10:43.968 --> 00:10:45.968
Of course you'd want those."

00:10:45.968 --> 00:10:48.801
[ Laughter ]

00:10:48.801 --> 00:10:52.400
"I have no follow-ups.
Just get to the joke, please."

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:54.567
That was the monologue,
everybody!

00:10:54.567 --> 00:10:57.634
♪♪

